{"id":1133,"level":68,"name":"Захист: відхід","group":"Захист","format":27,"description":"<p>Chess is not all about attacking. You often have to make a defensive move. It is important that you know how you can defend your pieces.</p>  <p>An attacked piece can be defended in four ways:</p>  <p><strong>Moving away:</strong> you move the attacked piece to a safe square<br /><strong>Blocking:</strong> you place another piece between the attacking piece and the piece that&rsquo;s being attacked. This is also called <em>interposing</em>.<br /><strong>Capturing:</strong> you take the attacking piece.<br /><strong>Protecting:</strong> you guard the piece that is under attack. After a capture, you strike back.</p>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />This exercise is about defense by means of moving away. Move your piece to a safe square to prevent material loss.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":27,"examples":[{"fen":"8/3k4/8/8/3K4/8/r7/N7 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Gb3,Rc2][%cal Ga2c2]} 1. Nb3 *","text":"<p>кінь майже потрапив у пастку, але ледь може втекти через поле b3 на шахівниці.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":50140,"fen":"8/2k2N1r/p1p1p3/6R1/4P3/2P1K3/P7/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rf7]} 1. Ne5 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49609,"fen":"r4rk1/p1pnqppp/1p1pp3/7n/Q1PP4/2B2PP1/PP2P1bP/R2RN1K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rg2]} 1... Bh3 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39525,"fen":"1qrBk2r/p2b1pp1/1p2p3/3pPp2/7P/2P3P1/PP2QP2/R3R1K1 w k - 0 1","pgn":"1. Bg5 1/2-1/2","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":48957,"fen":"2k2br1/1p3pp1/pP2p2p/P1p1B3/2P5/5PP1/4P1bP/3R2K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rg2]} 1... Bh3 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":48727,"fen":"2b5/p3kp1p/4pr1p/3pP3/2p2PP1/4K2P/PPP5/3R4 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rf6]} 1... Rg6 (1... d4+?  ) 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[